#: ../../../compiler_internals/metal_tilelang_development.md:227
msgid ""
"C in cooperative tensor or fragment form uses destination storage elision. C "
"in shared scope uses writeback. Warp partitioning prefers a balanced grid of "
"16x32 op-level fragments per simdgroup."
