"separate: it only chooses which MSL language version to request when "
"compiling the generated source. It cannot rewrite already generated MPP "
"source back to simdgroup. If `SelectInst` chose cooperative tensor, the "
"generated source is MPP source. Instruction-level runtime capability "
"fallback still needs a separate design."
